bubblewrap 0.8.0-2+deb12u1 plus the dated process-only proc patch.
Corresponding upstream and Debian source archives, descriptor, patch, license and build script are included.
Rebuild with Node 24, dpkg-dev, build-essential, pkg-config, libcap-dev and libselinux1-dev;
place the three agentarts inputs and scripts/build-agentarts-bwrap.mjs in their repository paths, then run the script.
--disable-man --enable-selinux --with-priv-mode=none; make -j2 bwrap. No setuid bit.
